41
00:03:22.872 --> 00:03:24.872
last! It is

42
00:03:24.873 --> 00:03:30.071
enough!" He fell back down and pulled himself close to

43
00:03:30.072 --> 00:03:33.351
Patrasche. They lay together

44
00:03:33.352 --> 00:03:38.899
again. The next morning, they were

45
00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:44.094
dead. In the morning, a crowd gathered around their still

46
00:03:44.095 --> 00:03:46.585
