51
00:04:03.227 --> 00:04:08.100
forehead. "Today was our playday," she said

52
00:04:08.101 --> 00:04:11.676
sadly. A stranger arrived at the

53
00:04:11.677 --> 00:04:17.263
cathedral. "I am looking for the boy who did this drawing!" he

54
00:04:17.264 --> 00:04:22.775
said. He was a famous artist, and he held Nello's picture in his

55
00:04:22.776 --> 00:04:30.944
hand. "This should be the winning picture," he insisted, "and I want to teach this young

56
